<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“Almost persuaded,” come, come today;</l><l>“Almost persuaded,” turn not away;</l><l>Jesus invites you here,</l><l>Angels are ling’ring near,</l><l>Prayers rise from hearts so dear;</l><l>O wand’rer, come!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Oh, be persuaded! Christ never fails—</l><l>Oh, be persuaded! His blood avails—</l><l>Can save from every sin,</l><l>Cleanse you without, within—</l><l>Will you not let Him in?</l><l>Open the door!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>“Almost persuaded,” harvest is past!</l><l>“Almost persuaded,” doom comes at last;</l><l>“Almost” cannot avail;</l><l>“Almost” is but to fail!</l><l>Sad, sad that bitter wail—</l><l>“Almost—but lost!”</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Be now persuaded, oh, sinner, hear!</l><l>Be now persuaded, Jesus is near;</l><l>His voice is pleading still,</l><l>Turn now with heart and will,</l><l>Peace will your spirit fill—</l><l>Oh, turn today!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
